$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=dlogser  LOC_AFTER=?

* A logarithmically weighted Dirichlet series is the shifted series of the shifted coefficients.

s1::simp1 |- ( ( A : NN --> CC /\ E e. CC /\ Z e. CC ) -> A : NN --> CC )
