i18::dlogtrm
s19:s17,i18:syl |- ( ( ( A : NN --> CC /\ E e. CC /\ Z e. CC ) /\ k e. NN ) -> ( ( ( ( A ` k ) x. ( log ` k ) ) x. ( k ^c -u E ) ) x. ( k ^c -u ( Z - E ) ) ) = ( ( ( A ` k ) x. ( log ` k ) ) x. ( k ^c -u Z ) ) )
s20:s6:oveq1d |- ( ( ( A : NN --> CC /\ E e. CC /\ Z e. CC ) /\ k e. NN ) -> ( ( ( q e. NN |-> ( ( ( A ` q ) x. ( log ` q ) ) x. ( q ^c -u E ) ) ) ` k ) x. ( k ^c -u ( Z - E ) ) ) = ( ( ( ( A ` k ) x. ( log ` k ) ) x. ( k ^c -u E ) ) x. ( k ^c -u ( Z - E ) ) ) )
s21:s20,s19:eqtrd |- ( ( ( A : NN --> CC /\ E e. CC /\ Z e. CC ) /\ k e. NN ) -> ( ( ( q e. NN |-> ( ( ( A ` q ) x. ( log ` q ) ) x. ( q ^c -u E ) ) ) ` k ) x. ( k ^c -u ( Z - E ) ) ) = ( ( ( A ` k ) x. ( log ` k ) ) x. ( k ^c -u Z ) ) )
qed:s21:sumeq2dv |- ( ( A : NN --> CC /\ E e. CC /\ Z e. CC ) -> sum_ k e. NN ( ( ( q e. NN |-> ( ( ( A ` q ) x. ( log ` q ) ) x. ( q ^c -u E ) ) ) ` k ) x. ( k ^c -u ( Z - E ) ) ) = sum_ k e. NN ( ( ( A ` k ) x. ( log ` k ) ) x. ( k ^c -u Z ) ) )
